! Minimal dilatancy test case
! Based on 3dinjection_permev.in but with dilatancy enabled
! Uses the simplest possible setup: small grid, flowrate injection, backslip

filenumber 2000
problem 3dp

! Grid: small to keep runtime fast
imax 20
jmax 20
ds 0.05

! Time stepping
nstep 50
interval 1
tmax 2.0
dtout 0.1

! Rate-and-state friction
a 0.02
b 0.015
dc 0.0005
f0 0.6
muinit 0.57
sigmainit 30.0
velinit 1e-12
backslip T
vpl 0d0

! Pressure diffusion
pressurediffusion T
injection flowrate
qinj 3e-4
tinj 3.0

! Fluid properties
phi 0.1
beta 5e-8
eta 0.89e-3
kp 1e-15

! Boundary conditions (Neumann = no-flow, the default)

! Permeability evolution via dilatancy (not rate-based)
permev T
kpmin 1e-16
kpmax 1e-13
kT 1e15
kL 1e-3

! DILATANCY
dilatancy T
Ld 1.0
eps_d 2e-4
beta_phi 1e-8
